>**Increase nation's Prosperity.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Gain your mission from {n:Hieronymus}.
* Head to the position in {z:North Gustaberg (S)} given to you in the mission description.
* Check the {p:???} at (H-10) to spawn a {m:Goblin Picaroon}.
* After killing the {m:Goblin Picaroon} check the {p:???} again.
** If you zone out of {z:North Gustaberg (S)} without checking the {p:???}, you will fail the mission.
* Report back to {n:Hieronymus} to complete the mission.

=2 Notes
* The {m:Goblin Picaroon} NM is a Goblin THF with 9450 HP.
** He occasionally triple-attacks, but neither hits very hard nor evades all that much.
* Can be soloed with ease by most 75's.
* Susceptible to sleep, bind, and gravity.
* The NM will {p:rage|Category:Jug Pets} if not killed in a reasonable timeframe.
* Others assisting with the fight may also check the ??? after the win for an exp/limit reward regardless of whether they have the mission active.

__However, if they do not have the mission active, they will not receive Allied Notes or credit for the victory.__
* Killable by: __(see {p:testimonials|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Talk:Delta_Strike_I_(Bastok)})__

=2 Game Description
\**Client:** {n:Hieronymus} ({z:Bastok Markets (S)})
Unit Requirement: 1 member
